---
title: "blob_sidecars_by_root_deprecated (Fulu -- Networking (P2P Interface))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_deprecated: current_epoch >= FULU_FORK_EPOCH + MIN_EPOCHS_FOR_BLOB_SIDECARS_REQUESTS
    q_check_deprecated --> q_fully_deprecated: fully deprecated
    q_check_deprecated --> q_compute_range: in transition period
    q_fully_deprecated --> [*]: respond empty or reject
    q_compute_range --> q_range: serve_range = [min(current_epoch - MIN_EPOCHS, FULU_FORK_EPOCH), FULU_FORK_EPOCH)
    q_range --> q_check_roots: for root in requested_roots
    q_check_roots --> q_check_block_epoch: lookup block for root
    q_check_block_epoch --> q_respond_empty: all roots at or after FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_block_epoch --> q_serve_sidecar: root in pre-Fulu serve_range
    q_respond_empty --> [*]: respond with empty list
    q_serve_sidecar --> q_check_roots: respond with blob sidecar, next root
    q_check_roots --> [*]: all roots processed
    note right of q_check_roots
        INV-001: Deprecated after FULU_FORK_EPOCH + MIN_EPOCHS_FOR_BLOB_SIDECARS_REQUESTS
        INV-002: Transition period serves only pre-Fulu blobs by root
        INV-003: Peers should not be penalized for requesting blob sidecars from FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    end note
